      "content": "look i get the disclaimer but im just looking for a straight answer so i can make a decision for tonight. is there any actual scientific reason why dex and sertraline wouldn't mix? like is there a known interaction or is it just something doctors say just to be safe? i just need to know if i'm gonna be okay if i take a dose so i can actually rest.",
